## Real bug found by the gate's first run

`make -jN sub-src sub-tools` as separate goals bypasses `CONFIG+=ordered` — and `tools/` shares `src/`'s `OBJECTS_DIR`/`MOC_DIR` (src.pri `$$PWD` anchoring), so two makes raced the same generated moc/object files and the link hit a half-written object (undefined `vtable`/`staticMetaObject`). The gate now builds one subdir per `make` call.

